00:12:28.240 --> 00:12:30.400
order the e-book,
audiobook, or hard copy

00:12:30.400 --> 00:12:33.280
of my last book,
“How to Survive a Pandemic”.

00:12:34.000 --> 00:12:37.440
For recipes, check out
my second-to-last book,

00:12:37.440 --> 00:12:39.680
my “How Not to Diet Cookbook”.

00:12:40.320 --> 00:12:42.960
It’s beautifully designed
with more than 100 recipes

00:12:42.960 --> 00:12:45.040
